ange lives in your Git history.","url":"https://x.com/sourcegraph/status/2046349195414798656","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/deep-search-can-now-search-git-tags-ancestry-and-commits-on-any-branch-to-pinpoint-where-a-change--dkivrvshv","summary":"Deep Search has been updated to support searching Git tags, ancestry, and commits across any branch, enabling developers to precisely locate where a specific change exists in their Git history.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--OHB84bZF--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2010","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-20T22:04:02.000Z"},{"id":"8MneFkGW2","title":"We just launched Smart Hover Summaries in beta. It reads your code to give you quick access to show key architectural details on hover.","url":"https://x.com/sourcegraph/status/2046348168380694613","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/we-just-launched-smart-hover-summaries-in-beta-it-reads-your-code-to-give-you-quick-access-to-show--8mnefkgw2","summary":"Smart Hover Summaries is a new beta feature that analyzes your codebase and displays key architectural details when hovering over code elements, providing quick contextual insights without leaving the editor.","image":"https://media.daily.dev/image/upload/s--CxzD6vbw--/f_auto/v1722860399/public/Placeholder%2005","num_upvotes":0,"num_comments":0,"created_at":"2026-04-20T21:59:57.000Z"},{"id":"YHvZdBf0j","title":"Code coverage numbers do not mean much if parts of your pipeline are being skipped.","url":"https://x.com/sourcegraph/status/2044923687162573053","comments_permalink":"https://app.daily.dev/posts/code-coverage-numbers-do-not-mean-much-if-parts-of-your-pipeline-are-being-skipped--yhvzdbf0j","summary":"Code coverage metrics can be misleading when parts of the CI/CD pipeline are being skipped or bypassed. High coverage numbers give a false sense of security if certain pipeline stages \u2014 such as test runs, linting, or security scans \u2014 are 